---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="What Protect Our Future Cayman collects through this site, why, who can see it, and how to ask for it to be deleted. Written for students and parents.">
  <Hero compact eyebrow="Privacy" title="What we collect, and what we do with it.">
    <p class="lede">Short version: only what a form asks for, only to reply to you, kept in one shared inbox, deleted when you ask.</p>
  </Hero>
  <section class="section surface-paper">
    <div class="container grid">
      <div class="privacy__body flow">
        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <p>Our forms ask for your name, email address, school if you are a student, an age bracket, and what you are interested in. We do not ask for your date of birth, home address or phone number.</p>
        <h2>Why</h2>
        <p>To reply to you, invite you to events, and help you join or start a chapter. We do not sell or share your details.</p>
        <h2>Under 16</h2>
        <p>If you tell us you are under 16, our reply asks that a parent, guardian or teacher knows you are in touch with POF. This site never puts anyone under 16 in direct one-to-one contact with an adult.</p>
        <h2>Who can see it</h2>
        <p>Form messages arrive in POF's shared organisational inbox, which POF's current leadership reads. Mailchimp holds newsletter emails. Form submissions pass through Formspree. Neither is used for anything except sending you what you asked for.</p>
        <h2>Photographs</h2>
        <p>We only publish photographs of people who have agreed to it, and for anyone under 18, whose parent or guardian has agreed. If you are in a photo on this site and want it removed, email us and it will come down.</p>
        <h2>Analytics and cookies</h2>
        <p>We use Cloudflare Web Analytics, which counts page views without cookies and without identifying you. This site sets no tracking cookies and shows no cookie banner because none is needed.</p>
        <h2>Fonts</h2>
        <p>This site serves its own fonts, so no request goes to a third party when a page loads.</p>
        <h2>Delete your details</h2>
        <p>Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}?subject=Delete%20my%20details`}>{SITE.email}</a> from the address you used and we will delete what we hold within two weeks and confirm.</p>
        <p class="meta">Last reviewed September 2026.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .privacy__body { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  @media (min-width: 64em) { .privacy__body { grid-column: 3 / 11; } }
</style>
